Package: weactterm
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libqrencode4 (>= 4.1.1), fonts-dejavu-core, fontconfig
Description: USB text terminal for WeAct FS35 CDC ACM displays
 Runs a Linux shell in a PTY and renders its UTF-8 terminal output on a
 WeAct Display FS V1 3.5-inch display. Uses libvterm and FreeType, with
 RGB565 little-endian output through the guarded library transport.
 Hardware access requires --run; the default is a memory-only dry-run.
 Includes read-only weact-list and weact-cli (WeActCLI) for text and images
 on verified FS35 and FS096 devices.

Package: libweact1
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: WeAct FS35 and FS096 graphics runtime library
 Model-specific graphics and guarded FS35 transport with legacy FS096 ABI.

Package: libweact-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libweact1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: WeAct graphics library development files
 Public C headers, static library, pkg-config metadata and safe example.
